From 74823080fd981a816942ead4514f877fa4775dc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Rob Herring (Arm)" <robh@kernel.org>
Date: Wed, 15 Oct 2025 18:12:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: Fix inconsistent quoting

commit 01585d7470aa5b8990645919dfbc2179171caaf9 upstream.

yamllint has gained a new check which checks for inconsistent quoting
(mixed " and ' quotes within a file). Fix all the cases yamllint found
so we can enable the check (once the check is in a release). As single
quotes are (slightly) preferred, use them throughout the modified files
even if double quotes are mostly used.

